1506	// so any cap is hang-safe as long as the workspace + dW-tile/embedding ownership
1507	// use the SAME nCTA (they read ctx.n_ctas). The shipped path passes 0 (full
1508	// saturation); a memory-constrained TEST passes a small cap so the per-CTA
